  "display_title": "The Path to Vengeance",
  "description": "Cha Chan-ok is a man in his forties that grew up believing that happiness shared is doubled and and sadness shared is halved. He is a good man that helps whenever and whoever. But that has come to bite him in the ass. After his father’s death, he has everything taken away from him - wealth, power, status, friends and even his family. However, his good disposition didn’t bring only misfortune. In the past, he ended up saving a young girl called Jae-hee. And after a traumatic event lands Chan-ok in the hospital, she’s the only one willing to help him turn things around. But his path to vengeance might not be as smooth as he’d like. Love, sex, betrayal and blackmail will all be part of the game. \n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
